\pard \b\fs36\cf1 Message Window
\par \plain\fs24 The message window for the Leo-32 \ul Server\plain\fs24 {\v Server_Overview} displays SEM operational messages.
\par Each message has a time stamp and the messages are listed in chronological order.
\par The last 100 messages (since the server was started) are displayed.
\par 
\par Messages are divided into three \ul categories\plain\fs24 {\v Message_categories}
\par 
\par Every message is inserted into the \ul message log\plain\fs24 {\v Message_log}
\par 
\par The Window caption indicates any \ul unacknowledged messages\plain\fs24 {\v Unacknowledged_messages}.which may be \ul reviewed\plain\fs24 {\v Review_Unacknowledged_Messages} if required.
\par \pard 
\par The system menu also provides a \ul Clear Window\plain\fs24 {\v Clear_Window} function
