\fs36\cf1 Message log
\par \plain\fs24 This is a file in which are recorded all the \ul error\plain\fs24 {\v Error_Messages}, \ul warning\plain\fs24 {\v Warning_messages} and\ul  information\plain\fs24 {\v Information_messages} messages of the SEM.
\par The file LEOLOG.LEO is located in the ...\'5cleo32\'5clog directory.
\par 
\par This file should not be edited or deleted. It is provided for Leo Service use as an aid to fault diagnosis.
\par 
\par A warning will be given if it reaches 1 Mb and on each succeeding 1Mb boundary.
\par If space is at a premium and the file is too large it may be copied to backup media and the file deleted (a new file will be created when the next message is output).
\par \pard The backed up file must be retained for Service inspection.
\par \page
