\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx8595\cellx12015\pard\intbl Clicking with the Right Mouse Button on the\uldb \b  Second Image Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v Second_Image_Window}\plain\fs24  displays the Pop Up Menu which provides the following functions:
\par\intbl \par\pard \pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f3 \'a1\f1 \tab \b Zoom Area\plain\fs24  displays the\uldb \b  Zoom Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v Zoom_Window}\plain\fs24  
\par\intbl \f3 \'a1\f1 \tab \b Zoom to 100%\plain\fs24  resets the zoom value
