{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Operating System Requirements}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Operating_System_Requirements}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Operating System Requirements
\par \pard \plain\fs24 The Second Image Window functions utilise the \b Imaging for Windows\plain\fs24  Controls.
\par These may not be installed or may not be available on the current Operating System.
\par 
\par \b Windows 98 and Windows NT 4.0\plain\fs24  include\b  Imaging for Windows\plain\fs24 , if this is not installed:
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab \b Start - Settings - Control Panel\plain\fs24 
\par \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab Double click on \b Add/Remove Programs\plain\fs24 
\par \f3\b \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\plain\fs24 \tab Select the\b  Windows Setup\plain\fs24  tab.\b 
\par \plain\f3\fs24 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1\b \tab \plain\fs24 Under \b Accessories\plain\fs24  select \b Imaging.\plain\fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 \b Windows 95\plain\fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 This requires installation of\b  Imaging for Windows 95\plain\fs24  and\b  Internet Explorer 4.01 SP1 
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 For convenience these are included on the Leo-32 CD\b 
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 To perform Installation (NB must be in this order)
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab Close all running programs
\par \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab Insert Leo-32 CD
\par \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab Browse the CD
\par \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab Double Click on  \'5cImaging\'5cSetup.exe - follow the installation instructions
\par \f3 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f1 \tab Double Click on  \'5cIE4SP1\'5cIE4Setup.exe - follow the installation instructions
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Magnification Display}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Magnification_Display}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Magnification Display
\par \pard \plain\fs24 This\uldb \b  SEM User Preference\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1F9HBAX} \plain\fs24 determines how the image magnification value is calculated for display.
\par 
\par If \b Current Output Device\plain\fs24  is selected then the magnification value displayed is calculated according to the currently selected Output Device (e.g. Display)
\par 
\par If \b Polaroid 545\plain\fs24  is selected then the magnification value displayed is always calculated for a Polaroid 545 regardless of the currently selected output device.
\par \page
